 "category_zh": "历史遗址",
 "category_en": "Historic site",
 "intro_zh": "嘉兴南湖作为中共一大会址的组成部分而彪炳史册。南湖分为东、西两湖，形似鸳鸯交颈，因此又名鸳鸯湖。景区包含南湖核心区、月河历史街区、七一广场等，是一个集旅游观光、南湖风光休闲娱乐、历史教育为一体的综合性历史文化景区。",
 "intro_en": "Jiaxing South Lake shines in history as an integral part of the site of the National Congress of the Communist Party of China. Nanhu is divided into East and West lakes, which are shaped like mandarin ducks crossing their necks, so it is also called Yuanyang Lake. The scenic area includes the core area of ​​Nanhu, Yuehe Historical Street, Qiyi Square, etc. It is a comprehensive historical and cultural scenic spot integrating tourism, Nanhu scenery, leisure and entertainment, and historical education.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
